<view class="page {{theme}}"><text class="eyebrow">MAKE IT YOUR OWN</text><view class="title">{{id ? '编辑批注' : '保存阅读标记'}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{title}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="info">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{valid}}"><view class="card annotation-quote"><text class="small muted">原文 · {{length}} 字符</text><scroll-view scroll-y="{{true}}" class="quote-scroll"><text selectable="true">{{quote}}</text></scroll-view></view><view class="chips"><button class="chip" data-kind="highlight" bindtap="onKind">{{kind === 'highlight' ? '✓ ' : ''}}高亮 / 批注</button><button class="chip" data-kind="bookmark" bindtap="onKind">{{kind === 'bookmark' ? '✓ ' : ''}}书签</button></view><view wx:if="{{kind === 'highlight'}}" class="chips color-choices"><button class="chip yellow" data-color="yellow" bindtap="onColor">{{color === 'yellow' ? '✓ ' : ''}}黄色</button><button class="chip green" data-color="green" bindtap="onColor">{{color === 'green' ? '✓ ' : ''}}绿色</button><button class="chip blue" data-color="blue" bindtap="onColor">{{color === 'blue' ? '✓ ' : ''}}蓝色</button></view><textarea class="field annotation-note" maxlength="4000" value="{{note}}" bindinput="onNote" adjust-position="{{true}}" cursor-spacing="24" placeholder="记下理解、疑问或自己的例句，可留空只保存标记。"/><view class="actions"><button disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="onCopy">复制原文与笔记</button><button class="primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="onSave">保存并返回</button></view><button wx:if="{{id}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="onDelete">删除这条标记</button><view class="footer">批注按原文字段定位，修改颜色和笔记不会改动正文。保存后的高亮、书签及阅读位置可随完整备份恢复。</view></view><button wx:else bindtap="onBack">返回阅读</button></view>
